**定理172.1（经典残留的局部可读性）。** 有

$$
\boxed{
\begin{aligned}
\mathfrak d_L(\varphi)
&:=D(\xi_0(\varphi),\xi_1(\varphi))\\
&=\frac{d_L}{\sqrt{2353}}
\sqrt{
\kappa^2(-7\cos2\varphi+48\sin2\varphi)^2
+(7\sin2\varphi+48\cos2\varphi)^2
}.
\end{aligned}
}
\tag{172.5}
$$

特别地，

$$
\boxed{
\min_\varphi\mathfrak d_L(\varphi)=\kappa d_L>0,
\qquad
\max_\varphi\mathfrak d_L(\varphi)=d_L.
}
\tag{172.6}
$$

